title Multi-tenant SaaS
direction down

Tenant admins [icon: admin]
End users [icon: users]

Platform [icon: cloud, color: indigo] {
  Control plane [color: purple] {
    Tenant service [icon: building]
    Billing service [icon: stripe]
    Provisioner [icon: terraform]
    Feature flags [icon: flag]
  }
  Data plane [color: blue] {
    Shared cell [description: small tenants] {
      Shared API [icon: server]
      Shared workers [icon: worker]
      Shared DB [icon: postgres, shape: cylinder, description: row-level security]
    }
    Dedicated cells [description: enterprise tenants] {
      Cell Acme [color: teal] {
        Acme API [icon: server]
        Acme DB [icon: postgres, shape: cylinder]
      }
      Cell Globex [color: teal] {
        Globex API [icon: server]
        Globex DB [icon: postgres, shape: cylinder]
      }
    }
  }
  Router [icon: split, description: tenant-aware]
}
Identity provider [icon: okta]

Tenant admins > Tenant service
End users > Router
Router > Shared API, Acme API, Globex API
Shared API > Shared DB
Shared API --> Shared workers
Acme API > Acme DB
Globex API > Globex DB
Tenant service > Provisioner
Provisioner --> Dedicated cells: creates
Tenant service > Billing service
Router <> Identity provider: SSO
Feature flags --> Data plane
